ne/godot/pull/112219.patch","merged_at":"2026-02-24T15:34:27Z"},"body":"Closes https://github.com/godotengine/godot-proposals/issues/13514 .\r\n\r\nThis PR displays code names (such as methods, signals, and properties) in a monospaced font throughout the editor. This fits better with their being written out in `snake_case` and otherwise representing code functions/values, where they are often seen in a monospaced font.\r\n\r\n## Covered cases\r\n- [x] Signal list\r\n- [x] List of methods to connect signal to\r\n- [x] \"Edit Connection\" dialog\r\n- [x] Dialogs for adding methods and properties to Animation\r\n- [x] AnimationPlayer Call Method track keyframes\r\n- [x] AnimationPlayer property names\r\n- [x] Method names in script editor list\r\n\r\n<img width=\"1166\" height=\"890\" alt=\"CleanShot 2025-10-30 at 12 52 46@2x\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/c6b863c9-bb1d-4a13-9bcd-25ef41289f89\" />\r\n<img width=\"1490\" height=\"1094\" alt=\"CleanShot 2025-10-30 at 12 53 09@2x\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/c5c1a406-e35c-4b75-9eaf-995b2f4f1b63\" />\r\n<img width=\"872\" height=\"296\" alt=\"CleanShot 2025-10-30 at 19 40 09@2x\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/562869b0-1d22-432f-9d08-b880a5879b7f\" />\r\n<img width=\"916\" height=\"886\" alt=\"CleanShot 2025-10-30 at 19 40 25@2x\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/0e13a0de-10dd-4045-ba9d-cb046987cb63\" />","closed_by":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url"